{"id":"018ebd908b6f5c76","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-ordered-tree-domain.md","title":"有限有序树的地址域","display":"df-ordered-tree-domain — 有限有序树的地址域","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-ordered-tree-domain","aliases":["73-df-ordered-tree-domain"],"display":"df-ordered-tree-domain — 有限有序树的地址域","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§1.4–1.5, print pp. 18–28; PDF pp. 40–50; local typed sequences, trees or finite closure","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§1.2, pp. 2–4; §4.3, pp. 82–84; scans 10–12, 90–92; local address representation","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":1},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-ordered-tree-domain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-ordered-tree-domain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordered-tree-domain — 有限有序树的地址域"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§1.4–1.5, print pp. 18–28; PDF pp. 40–50; local typed sequences, trees or finite closure"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§1.2, pp. 2–4; §4.3, pp. 82–84; scans 10–12, 90–92; local address representation"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为候选集合，节点地址是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 中的有限序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(d,u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_D\">\\(\\kappa_D\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Leaf}\">\\(\\operatorname{Leaf}\\)</span> 的子句中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)\\)</span>，不将这个前提施加给候选谓词本身。序列连接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 是根地址。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}tree\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Child}_D(d)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:d\\langle i\\rangle\\in D\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}tree\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Child}_D(d)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:d\\langle i\\rangle\\in D\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}tree\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land0&lt;|D|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\varepsilon\\in D\\land(\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(uv\\in D\\Longrightarrow u\\in D))\\land(\\forall d\\in D\\cap\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Child}_D(d)=\\{1,\\ldots,k\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}tree\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land0&lt;|D|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\varepsilon\\in D\\land(\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(uv\\in D\\Longrightarrow u\\in D))\\land(\\forall d\\in D\\cap\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Child}_D(d)=\\{1,\\ldots,k\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}tree\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\kappa_D(d)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Child}_D(d)|\\quad(d\\in D),\\qquad\\operatorname{Leaf}(D)\\coloneqq\\{d\\in D:\\kappa_D(d)=0\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}tree\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\kappa_D(d)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Child}_D(d)|\\quad(d\\in D),\\qquad\\operatorname{Leaf}(D)\\coloneqq\\{d\\in D:\\kappa_D(d)=0\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>子节点编号连续且从 1 开始，地址前缀表示祖先关系。有限性排除了无限下降的递归义务；两个树按地址域与标记函数直接比较，无须在后续歧义定义中再除以图同构。</p>\n<p>候选树域的子节点连续性仅对地址型成员求值；若 D 含非地址对象，第一项已使 TreeDom(D) 为假，其他项仍有明确真值，不依赖合取短路来解释越域函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D$ 为候选集合，节点地址是 $\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}$ 中的有限序列。$d,u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}$，$i\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$。在 $\\kappa_D$ 和 $\\operatorname{Leaf}$ 的子句中固定 $\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)$，不将这个前提施加给候选谓词本身。序列连接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]；$\\varepsilon$ 是根地址。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"d,u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Leaf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}tree\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Child}_D(d)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}:d\\langle i\\rangle\\in D\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}tree\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}\\land0<|D|<\\aleph_0\\land\\varepsilon\\in D\\land(\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}\\;(uv\\in D\\Longrightarrow u\\in D))\\land(\\forall d\\in D\\cap\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Child}_D(d)=\\{1,\\ldots,k\\})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}tree\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\kappa_D(d)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Child}_D(d)|\\quad(d\\in D),\\qquad\\operatorname{Leaf}(D)\\coloneqq\\{d\\in D:\\kappa_D(d)=0\\}","display":true}],"bytes":2501,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-ordered-tree-domain]]"},{"id":"5156102396088b66","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$A\\in V$，$t$ 为候选树。树地址与 $\\kappa_D$ 见 [[73-df-ordered-tree-domain]]；文法结构见 [[73-df-cfg-structure]]。推导树允许非终结符作叶。"},{"id":"4723b54e4035a6fb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$c$ 为候选证书，$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)$ 与节点子数 $\\kappa_D$ 见 [[73-df-ordered-tree-domain]]。结构谓词的定义不预设 $c$ 有效。在 $\\operatorname{PC}_c$ 与 $\\operatorname{PrattCode}$ 的递归子句中固定 $\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n)$ 和 $c=(D,N,A)$，其中 $N:D\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}$、$A:D\\to\\mathbb N$ 是该证书的唯一分量；$d\\in D$，子节点下标为 $j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\kappa_D(d)\\}$。局部整除检验中的 $e\\in\\mathbb N$ 是在断言中量化的指数见证；对未通过乘积检验的候选标签不调用非整数指数的模幂。"},{"id":"4863e6af7073a451","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(T)$，$s\\in T$，$C:T\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_T$。$t$ 为候选对象；下式中的树域 $D$ 与标记函数 $\\ell$ 均由存在量词绑定，$d$ 由节点量词绑定，$j\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$ 为子节点下标。$\\operatorname{TreeDom},\\kappa_D$ 见 [[73-df-ordered-tree-domain]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-ordered-tree-domain|有限有序树的地址域]]"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}